# Fieldserver environment. Copy to fieldserver/.env and fill in.
#
# Coordinates for BirdNET's species-occurrence filter, used for captures that
# have no GPS of their own — a clip dropped on the dashboard, mostly. Phone
# captures carry their own and ignore these.
#
# It matters: BirdNET is a global model, so an unfiltered Utah recording comes
# back as Rook and Torresian Crow, and because those species have trained
# call-type heads the wrong species gets a confident call type hung off it.
#
# Roughly your usual recording ground — a town is precise enough for an
# occurrence filter. Env rather than source: nothing location-specific belongs
# in the repo. Leave unset and the filter is simply off for GPS-less captures,
# which is honest rather than guessed.
FIELD_LAT=
FIELD_LON=
